+
+## F2 reusable presentation candidate
+
+GunContext owns the identical contextual paragraph across eight pages. PreferenceToggle owns native switches used by Settings and both drill setup pages. SettingsSection and SettingsAction live in apps/web/src/features/settings/components with colocated CSS, tests and public entries. Feature component packages join the architecture verification; no component acquires persistence or capture.
+
